			name: 'dall-e-3'
			format: 'OpenAI'
			version: '3.0'
		}
		sku: {
			name: 'Standard'
			capacity: 1
		}
	}
]
```

2. This is the way it should be working currently - the object is set up so that two deployments of the same model have to pass the name with unique values. We either change the default value to the model's name, or make the name a required field and have validation for uniqueness - but both would break the backwards compatibility on model's named "<account_name>-deployment"


