### Check for previous/existing GitHub issues

- [x] I have checked for previous/existing GitHub issues

### Issue Type?

Bug

### Module Name

avm/res/web/static-site

### (Optional) Module Version

0.9.5

### Description

When deploying with private endpoint and a custom Private DNS Zone the module fails with:


New-AzDeployment: /home/runner/work/.../common/.github/workflows/helpers/deploy-resources.ps1:45
Line |
  45 |          $deployment = New-AzSubscriptionDeployment @params
     |                        ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
     | 10:16:55 - Error: Code=InvalidTemplate; Message=Deployment template
     | validation failed: 'The template resource
     | 'Microsoft.Resources/deployments/k6ubsbiobwma6-staticSite-PrivateEndpoint-0' reference to 'Microsoft.Resources/deployments/k6ubsbiobwma6-staticSite-PrivateDnsZone' requires an API version. Please see https://aka.ms/arm-syntax for usage details.'.
Error: Error: The process '/usr/bin/pwsh' failed with exit code 1


Example code:

module staticAppList 'static-site-0.9.5-fix.json' =[
  for app in items(staticApps): {
  scope: resourceGroup(rgName)
  params: {
    name: app.value.name
    sku: 'Standard'
    tags: { 'hidden-title': 'stapp-${locationShort}-${useCaseName}-${app.key}-${env}' }
    appSettings: {
      TENANT_ID: tenant().tenantId
    }
    createPrivateDnsZone: 'Disabled'
    privateEndpoints: !(app.value.?publicNetworkAccess ?? false)
        ? [
            {
              subnetResourceId: vars.data.resources['sub-${useCaseName}-${env}'].virtualNetworks['vnet-${locationShort}-${useCaseName}-${env}'].subnets['snet-front'].id
              privateDnsZoneGroup: {
                privateDnsZoneGroupConfigs: [
                  {
                    privateDnsZoneResourceId: vars.data.resources['sub-connectivity'].privateDNSZones['privatelink.6.azurestaticapps.net'].id
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        : null
  }
}
]

### (Optional) Correlation Id

_No response_

